      "chunk_type": "text",
      "text": "Positioning the speakers\nThe size and shape of these speakers make it easy to position them directly next to your c omputer. For proper performance, place the right speaker to the right and the left speaker to the left of your computer. Make sure there is equal distance on either side. This provides an accurate sound stage.",
