      "chunk_type": "text",
      "text": "using the three cables\nCaution: Do not plug in the AC power cord until all other connections are completed.  Speaker cable ( ): Insert the free end into the To Left Speaker connector on the right speaker.  Audio input cable ( ): Insert one end into the Audio Input connector on the right speaker. Insert the other end into the Headphone or Speaker connector (the labels and positions of these connectors vary) on your computer.",
